Aerie-Purpose: Give the Settings page the four strings of the default blocking level menu in the Aerie Guard section.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/browser/ui/webui/settings (settings_localized_strings_provider.cc)
Aerie-Kind: hook

Issue #109. The messages are in the overlay (chrome/browser/ui/webui/aerie_guard_settings/
aerie_guard_settings_strings.grdp, added to the grd by adblock/0022). This patch only adds
their four names to AddAerieGuardStrings(), the function that adblock/0022 adds, so it
comes after adblock/0022 in the series.

--- a/chrome/browser/ui/webui/settings/settings_localized_strings_provider.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/ui/webui/settings/settings_localized_strings_provider.cc
@@ -1597,6 +1597,11 @@
       {"aerieGuardErrorTooManySites",
        IDS_SETTINGS_AERIE_GUARD_ERROR_TOO_MANY_SITES},
       {"aerieGuardErrorGeneric", IDS_SETTINGS_AERIE_GUARD_ERROR_GENERIC},
+      {"aerieGuardDefaultLevel", IDS_SETTINGS_AERIE_GUARD_DEFAULT_LEVEL},
+      {"aerieGuardDefaultLevelDesc",
+       IDS_SETTINGS_AERIE_GUARD_DEFAULT_LEVEL_DESC},
+      {"aerieGuardLevelAggressive", IDS_SETTINGS_AERIE_GUARD_LEVEL_AGGRESSIVE},
+      {"aerieGuardLevelStandard", IDS_SETTINGS_AERIE_GUARD_LEVEL_STANDARD},
   };
   html_source->AddLocalizedStrings(kLocalizedStrings);
 }
